{"sections":[{"slug":"旗流形","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"旗流形"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">旗流形</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"旗流形"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<h3>$\\mathrm{GL}_n$</h3>\n<p>$n$ <span lang=\"zh\">维线性空间</span> $V$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的一个旗即一列子空间</span>\n$$\r\nV_\\bullet = (0\\subset V_1 \\subset\\cdots\\subset V_n=V),\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">其中</span> $\\dim V_i = i$.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">令</span> $G=\\mathrm{GL}_n(\\mathbb{R})$, $B$ <span lang=\"zh\">为上三角矩阵的子群</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">那么</span> $\\mathbb{R}^n$ <span lang=\"zh\">的旗等同于陪集空间</span> $G/B$ <span lang=\"zh\">的元素</span>.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">代数群</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于代数群</span> $G$,</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">旗簇</span> $\\mathrm{Fl}$ <span lang=\"zh\">同构于任何一个</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Borel子群","text":"Borel <span lang=\"zh\">子群</span>"}},{"Plain":" $B$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/陪集空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">陪集空间</span>"}},{"Plain":" $G/B$.</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">旗簇</span> $\\mathrm{Fl}$ <span lang=\"zh\">可视为</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Borel子群","text":"Borel <span lang=\"zh\">子群</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/模空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">模空间</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">这就是说</span> $\\mathrm{Fl}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的点一一对应于</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> Borel <span lang=\"zh\">子群</span>.</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">群</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">作用于旗簇</span> $\\mathrm{Fl}$ <span lang=\"zh\">上</span>,\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">一种看法将</span> $\\mathrm{Fl}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的一个点视为一面旗子</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $\\mathrm{GL}_n$ <span lang=\"zh\">的情形就是完整的旗子</span>), <span lang=\"zh\">则一面旗子的稳定子群是一个</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Borel子群","text":"Borel <span lang=\"zh\">子群</span>"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">另一种看法是</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">共轭作用于</span> Borel <span lang=\"zh\">子群的模空间上</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">固定一个</span> Borel <span lang=\"zh\">子群</span> $B$, <span lang=\"zh\">有一个同构</span> $G/B\\to \\mathrm{Fl}$, $x \\mapsto xBx^{-1}$.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Weyl群","text":"Weyl <span lang=\"zh\">群</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的元素</span> $w$ <span lang=\"zh\">有一个局部闭子簇</span> $BwB$, <span lang=\"zh\">即</span> $w$ (<span lang=\"zh\">提升后视为中心化子</span> $N_G(T)$ <span lang=\"zh\">的元素</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $(B, B)$-<span lang=\"zh\">作用下的轨道</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">相关概念</span></h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/Bruhat分解","text":"Bruhat <span lang=\"zh\">分解</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}}]}